From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sarol263@student.otago.ac.nz>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:11:23 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 05/62] Plutonium: windowBroker.close() and snapshot() for the
 agent bridge

EmbeddedWindows::Close asks the toplevel to close as its close button
would. EmbeddedWindows::Snapshot copies the host window's layer with a
CopyOutputRequest (drawn even while parked) and crops it to the window
geometry; the broker returns it as a PNG Blob. The renderer also logs
which element answered an embedded-window hit-test query (EXO-EMBED).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
